title Red takes the ball
intro Blue is running with the ball.
flip vertical

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player B-CM at 48, 34
  player R-CM at 58, 34
  ball with B-CM

step
  caption Blue is running forward with the ball.

step
  caption Red runs beside Blue, shoulder to shoulder, and pokes the ball away.
  R-CM to 51, 34
  ball with R-CM
  arrow from R-CM to ball
  duration 1100

question
  prompt Is that a foul?
  answer No
  wrong Yes
  wrong Yes, it was a push
  wrong Only in the box
  correct No foul.
  why Red went for the ball, not the player. Running shoulder to shoulder is allowed.

question
  prompt What happens now?
  answer Play on
  wrong Blue gets a free kick
  wrong Blue gets a throw-in
  wrong The game stops
  correct Play on.
  why Nothing wrong happened, so nobody stops. Red has the ball and the game keeps going.
